OL,3,GNEWSAPiccadilly Gardens transformation
OL,4,Aplans approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FManchester City Council has given the
OL,7,Fgo-ahead for a major transformation of
OL,8,FPiccadilly Gardens in a bid to improve
OL,9,Fsafety and change perceptions of the
OL,10,Fcity-centre park.
OL,12,FWork is due to begin in November and
OL,13,Fwill include new lawns, more trees, a
OL,14,Flarger playground, extra CCTV and
OL,15,Fimproved lighting.
OL,17,FThe project, a collaboration with
OL,18,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) and
OL,19,FTransport for Greater Manchester
OL,20,F(TfGM), aims to tackle anti-social
OL,21,Fbehaviour and make the area more
OL,22,Fwelcoming.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
